WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,690
Brother, you are not taking this lightly.

2
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:04,090
These are all New Year thoughts

3
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:05,290
Brother Wang, don't be polite to me.

4
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:09,940
Hello boss

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:13,740
Now please arrange for someone to go to the warehouse to pick up a product and deliver it to my office.

6
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:17,960
In fact, you don’t come to me

7
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,560
I'm also going to give you something

8
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,360
It's better when you come today

9
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,560
Take the things together

10
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,810
What meat?

11
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:31,800
Mr. Wang, the things have been delivered.

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:36,330
I asked a friend to get this from Delay.

13
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:38,330
Only locals can get it and it tastes good

14
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,730
Take it back and give it to your girl to try

15
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:40,730
He should like it

16
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,130
Or use it to entertain guests
